      <br />
      <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28698222/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the study →</a>
      <br /><br />
      Longland, T.J.M., et al. (2016). <em>Higher Compared with Lower Dietary Protein During an Energy Deficit
